uby>所<rt>서ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>約束<rt>역ˆ석</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>代誌<rt>대지</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    sôr-yôrk-sork’e tai-ji\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>到底<rt>ᄃᅷˋ되ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>감<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>猶<rt>얗ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>會<rt>에-</rt></ruby><ruby>記<rt>기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tàu-toè lì kâm-yâh-e-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>是<rt>시-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥人<rt>샬ˆ랑ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>心虛<rt>심ˉ희ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    si-siâ̰-láng’e sīm-hî\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>等<rt>단ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>幾<rt>귀ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>年<rt>니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tân-lì kûi-loh-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>看<rt>콸ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>日子<rt>띧즤ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>開<rt>퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khoà̰-bo-lì’e rit-jì sîm boe-khûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>踮<rt>댬ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>時<rt>시ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jît\">這<rt>짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>刻<rt>켹</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tiàm-jît-sí jît-khiek\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>最後<rt>줴ˋᄋᅷˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby>才<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>覺醒<rt>각ˆ칠ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    juè-āu jiâh-lai-kâk-chḭ̀\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>墜落<rt>뒤롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>深坑<rt>침ˉ킬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>撥<rt>봫ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>𣍐<rt>뾔-</rt></ruby><ruby>離<rt>리ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    tui-loh-ài-jiéng’e chīm-khḭ̂ poâh-boe-lī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>如今<rt>뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>對<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>痴心<rt>치ˉ심ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ru-kîm tùi-lì’e chī-sîm\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>變成<rt>볜솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>雲煙<rt>훈옌ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>消失<rt>ᄉᆤˉ싣</rt></ruby>’킈\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    pien-sieng-hun-yên siāu-sit’khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>可憐<rt>코ˆ롄-</rt></ruby><ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>花蕊<rt>훼ˉ뤼ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    khô-lien-ài-jiéng’e huē-lùi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>氣味<rt>키ˋ삐ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-khì-bī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一吋<rt>짇춘ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>相思<rt>슐ˉ싀ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>一吋<rt>짇춘ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>淚<rt>뤼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-chùn-siṵ̄-sî jit-chùn-lūi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想欲<rt>슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>挽回<rt>빤ˆ훼ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>藥<rt>욯-</rt></ruby><ruby>醫<rt>이ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-bêh-lai-bân-hué bo-yoh-î\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>哀怨<rt>애ˉ완ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>雨聲<rt>허샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>吼<rt>ᄒᅷˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>規暝<rt>귀ˉ미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    āi-oān’e hor-siâ̰ hâu-kūi-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>心<rt>심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>稀微<rt>히ˉ삐ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <sp